.TH WERKMEISTER-ISSUE-CREATE 1 "" "werkmeister" "Werkmeister Manual"
.SH NAME
werkmeister\-issue\-create \- File a new issue and print its URL (Jira)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBwerkmeister issue create\fR
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-project <key>\fR
The Jira project key to file in
.TP
\fB\-\-type <type>\fR
bug, feature or task (mapped to the tracker's issue type)
.TP
\fB\-\-title <text>\fR
The issue's summary
.TP
\fB\-\-body\-file <path>\fR
The issue's description, from a file (\- for stdin)
.PP
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBwerkmeister\fR(1)
